10 REM CAT-ON-RUG - Cat laying on a rug (hi-res graphics)
20 REM Uses CORRECT Applesoft BASIC commands from JACE docs:
30 REM HGR, HCOLOR=, HPLOT TO x,y
40 REM
50 REM === INITIALIZE HI-RES GRAPHICS ===
60 HGR
70 REM
80 REM === WALL BACKGROUND (light green) ===
90 HCOLOR=1
100 FOR Y = 0 TO 191: HPLOT 0,Y TO 279,Y: NEXT Y
110 REM
120 REM === STARS IN WALL (white dots - small diamonds) ===
130 HCOLOR=3
140 REM Star at upper left
150 HPLOT 30,20 TO 32,18 TO 34,20 TO 32,22 TO 30,20
160 REM Star at upper right
170 HPLOT 250,15 TO 252,13 TO 254,15 TO 252,17 TO 250,15
180 REM Star near center top
190 HPLOT 140,10 TO 142,8 TO 144,10 TO 142,12 TO 140,10
200 REM Star at far right
210 HPLOT 260,50 TO 262,48 TO 264,50 TO 262,52 TO 260,50
220 REM Star at left middle
230 HPLOT 20,80 TO 22,78 TO 24,80 TO 22,82 TO 20,80
240 REM
250 REM === RUG BASE (brown - using white with pattern) ===
260 HCOLOR=3
270 FOR Y = 100 TO 191: HPLOT 0,Y TO 279,Y: NEXT Y
280 REM
290 REM === RUG STRIPES (green diagonal lines) ===
300 HCOLOR=5
310 FOR Y = 106 TO 185 STEP 8
320 HPLOT 0,Y TO 279,Y+4
330 NEXT Y
340 REM
350 REM === FLOWERS ON RUG (white) ===
360 HCOLOR=3
370 REM Flower at left (small circle made of lines)
380 HPLOT 100,150 TO 102,146 TO 106,145 TO 108,148 TO 106,152
390 HPLOT 106,152 TO 102,154 TO 98,152 TO 96,148 TO 98,144
400 HPLOT 98,144 TO 100,140 TO 104,138 TO 108,140 TO 110,144
410 HPLOT 110,144 TO 108,148 TO 106,152 TO 102,154 TO 98,152
420 REM Flower at right
430 HPLOT 200,130 TO 202,126 TO 206,125 TO 208,128 TO 206,132
440 HPLOT 206,132 TO 202,134 TO 198,132 TO 196,128 TO 198,124
450 HPLOT 198,124 TO 200,120 TO 204,118 TO 208,120 TO 210,124
460 HPLOT 210,124 TO 208,128 TO 206,132 TO 202,134 TO 198,132
470 REM Flower at center-right
480 HPLOT 150,170 TO 152,166 TO 156,165 TO 158,168 TO 156,172
490 HPLOT 156,172 TO 152,174 TO 148,172 TO 146,168 TO 148,164
500 HPLOT 148,164 TO 150,160 TO 154,158 TO 158,160 TO 160,164
510 HPLOT 160,164 TO 158,168 TO 156,172 TO 152,174 TO 148,172
520 REM
530 REM === CAT BODY (orange - using odd columns) ===
540 REM Cat is sleeping on rug, facing left
550 HCOLOR=5
560 REM Body - elongated oval shape
570 HPLOT 140,130 TO 160,128 TO 180,130 TO 195,135 TO 200,145
580 HPLOT 200,145 TO 198,155 TO 195,162 TO 185,165 TO 170,166
590 HPLOT 155,166 TO 140,164 TO 130,160 TO 125,155 TO 122,148
600 HPLOT 122,148 TO 124,140 TO 128,135 TO 135,132 TO 140,130
610 REM
620 REM === CAT HEAD (orange) ===
630 HPLOT 128,135 TO 120,128 TO 110,125 TO 100,128 TO 92,135
640 HPLOT 92,135 TO 88,145 TO 90,155 TO 98,160 TO 108,162
650 HPLOT 118,162 TO 125,158 TO 128,152 TO 130,145 TO 130,140
660 HPLOT 130,140 TO 128,135
670 REM
680 REM === CAT EARS (orange) ===
690 REM Left ear
700 HPLOT 108,127 TO 102,112 TO 95,118 TO 100,125
710 REM Right ear
720 HPLOT 122,124 TO 118,108 TO 112,116 TO 116,124
730 REM
740 REM === CAT TAIL (orange, curving up) ===
750 HPLOT 195,160 TO 205,155 TO 215,148 TO 220,138
760 HPLOT 220,138 TO 218,128 TO 215,120 TO 210,115 TO 205,112
770 REM
780 REM === CAT OUTLINE (black) ===
790 HCOLOR=4
800 REM Body outline
810 HPLOT 140,130 TO 160,128 TO 180,130 TO 195,135 TO 200,145
820 HPLOT 200,145 TO 198,155 TO 195,162 TO 185,165 TO 170,166
830 HPLOT 155,166 TO 140,164 TO 130,160 TO 125,155 TO 122,148
840 HPLOT 122,148 TO 124,140 TO 128,135 TO 135,132 TO 140,130
850 REM Head outline
860 HPLOT 128,135 TO 120,128 TO 110,125 TO 100,128 TO 92,135
870 HPLOT 92,135 TO 88,145 TO 90,155 TO 98,160 TO 108,162
880 HPLOT 118,162 TO 125,158 TO 128,152 TO 130,145 TO 130,140
890 HPLOT 130,140 TO 128,135
900 REM Ear outlines
910 HPLOT 108,127 TO 102,112 TO 95,118 TO 100,125
920 HPLOT 122,124 TO 118,108 TO 112,116 TO 116,124
930 REM Tail outline
940 HPLOT 195,160 TO 205,155 TO 215,148 TO 220,138
950 HPLOT 220,138 TO 218,128 TO 215,120 TO 210,115 TO 205,112
960 REM
970 REM === CAT FACE DETAILS (black) ===
980 REM Eye (closed - sleeping cat, a small line)
990 HPLOT 100,140 TO 106,142
1000 REM Nose
1010 HPLOT 92,148 TO 92,151
1020 REM Whiskers
1030 HPLOT 95,148 TO 82,146
1040 HPLOT 94,150 TO 80,150
1050 HPLOT 95,152 TO 82,154
1060 REM
1070 REM === DONE ===
1080 PRINT "DONE"
1090 END
